And I thought you, Mr. Scientist, were all up on saving the planet with your technological advancement.

35
00:02:31,930 --> 00:02:36,570
Um, well, I am just going to get some coffee while you two keep discussing.

36
00:02:41,880 --> 00:02:42,920
