But just give us one room, you know, like five meters by five meters where we can put anything we want.

51
00:03:29,080 --> 00:03:35,120
A beer cooler, a TV, a PS3, a sound system, and a couple guitars.

52
00:03:35,120 --> 00:03:36,620
Yeah, probably, yeah, yeah.

