There was even a TV show in America years ago called Picket Fences.

112
00:06:48,240 --> 00:06:56,330
And I think a picket fence is kind of this ideal in American culture about having your own home in the suburbs and having your own space.

113
00:06:56,680 --> 00:07:01,620
And so around your yard, around your garden, you have this white picket fence.

114
00:07:01,620 --> 00:07:04,940
And so a picket is, I think, the pointed part.

115
00:07:04,940 --> 00:07:12,560
So a picket fence is thin pieces of wood that stand in the ground and are connected to protect your property from other people coming inside.

116
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:12,690
Okay.

117
00:07:13,560 --> 00:07:14,290
So that's a white picket fence.

118
00:07:14,560 --> 00:07:15,410
You'll hear it all the time.

119
00:07:16,120 --> 00:07:21,830
Usually in movies or in TV shows, they talk about having their own little house with their dog and a white picket fence.

120
00:07:22,160 --> 00:07:22,470
Exactly.

121
00:07:22,850 --> 00:07:23,770
Two kids, two cars.

122
00:07:24,270 --> 00:07:25,050
And a white picket fence.

123
00:07:25,870 --> 00:07:26,150
All right.

124
00:07:26,820 --> 00:07:30,050
So now the woman argued that she wanted something a little bit more modern.

125
00:07:31,060 --> 00:07:32,800
And well, the guy said, you know what?

126
00:07:33,530 --> 00:07:34,570
It's just wasted space.

127
00:07:34,870 --> 00:07:37,690
And those types of homes are just a fad.

128
00:07:38,440 --> 00:07:39,140
A fad.

129
00:07:39,800 --> 00:07:42,700
So a fad is something that is passing.

130
00:07:43,240 --> 00:07:45,740
It's something that's popular for a short time, but then it goes away.

131
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:46,860
It's not popular anymore.

132
00:07:47,560 --> 00:07:48,560
Right.

133
00:07:48,560 --> 00:07:49,560
So...

134
00:07:49,560 --> 00:07:55,280
For example, I think for a while, remember those shoes that used to have little red lights in the back and the heel?

135
00:07:55,740 --> 00:07:56,060
Oh yeah.

136
00:07:56,400 --> 00:07:57,240
LA lights.

137
00:07:57,400 --> 00:07:58,400
LA lights.

138
00:07:58,400 --> 00:07:59,400
Those were a fad.

139
00:07:59,400 --> 00:08:02,160
It was really popular for like a year.

140
00:08:02,160 --> 00:08:04,920
Everyone had them, everyone wore them, and then they just went away.

141
