One of my favorite fads of the 1980s were those shirts that would change color if the room temperature changed color.

142
00:08:12,320 --> 00:08:14,680
So if you go outside and it's hot, they would become bright pink.

143
00:08:15,120 --> 00:08:17,480
But if you're in a cold room, they would go blue and green.

144
00:08:17,920 --> 00:08:21,840
It was really fun, but they're definitely out of fashion these days.

145
00:08:21,840 --> 00:08:23,000
Yeah, I don't think they wear them anymore.

146
00:08:23,760 --> 00:08:24,640
So that's a fad.

147
00:08:25,340 --> 00:08:26,280
Something that's temporary.

148
00:08:26,880 --> 00:08:27,980
It's popular for a while.

149
00:08:28,920 --> 00:08:31,900
So he called her house a fad and she says, well, what about your house?

150
00:08:32,360 --> 00:08:33,980
All this vintage furniture.

151
00:08:34,540 --> 00:08:35,500
What's vintage?

152
00:08:35,640 --> 00:08:36,640
Vintage?

153
00:08:37,140 --> 00:08:39,000
Well, some people think that vintage is a fad.

154
00:08:39,180 --> 00:08:43,500
A lot of people really enjoy buying vintage furniture or vintage clothing.

155
00:08:44,120 --> 00:08:45,420
Vintage means old.

156
00:08:45,520 --> 00:08:46,520
Old.

157
00:08:46,820 --> 00:08:50,600
It's a nice way of saying old or like a nice or cool way of saying old.

158
00:08:50,860 --> 00:08:51,020
Yeah.

159
00:08:51,080 --> 00:08:57,470
So it's almost like, for example, right now, 1940s and 50s clothes are very popular.

160
00:08:57,640 --> 00:09:00,440
A lot of girls are into this kind of style.

161
00:09:00,440 --> 00:09:05,680
So it's called vintage clothing because it's not from today's styles.

162
00:09:05,680 --> 00:09:06,390
It's an old style.

163
00:09:07,080 --> 00:09:12,970
Or you could even call those big flowing dresses from the 1970s vintage clothing.

164
00:09:13,440 --> 00:09:19,720
So vintage furniture would be furniture that comes from a different time, a different era, and it's popular now.

165
00:09:19,720 --> 00:09:20,720
Right.

166
00:09:20,720 --> 00:09:21,720
They're popular now.

167
00:09:21,720 --> 00:09:22,750
Or people like to buy them now.

168
00:09:23,360 --> 00:09:24,360
That's right.

169
00:09:24,360 --> 00:09:25,550
So they're special because they come from a different time.

170
00:09:26,240 --> 00:09:27,240
Okay.

171
00:09:27,240 --> 00:09:31,600
So those are the words that we have for today on Language Takeaway.

172
00:09:31,600 --> 00:09:40,840
