00:10:08,000 --> 00:10:08,210
All right.

181
00:10:09,000 --> 00:10:09,310
So that's the first one.

182
00:10:10,040 --> 00:10:10,480
Sweetums.

183
00:10:11,000 --> 00:10:11,440
Sweetums.

184
00:10:11,740 --> 00:10:14,200
So obviously the main part of this word is sweet.

185
00:10:15,080 --> 00:10:16,260
Sweetum, Sweetums.

186
00:10:16,680 --> 00:10:18,440
And this is a way to say, hey, sweetie.

187
00:10:19,400 --> 00:10:20,400
Sweetums.

188
00:10:20,400 --> 00:10:21,400
Sweetums.

189
00:10:21,400 --> 00:10:22,760
So you can say sweetie or sweetums.

190
00:10:22,760 --> 00:10:23,760
Exactly.

191
00:10:23,760 --> 00:10:25,840
So that's a nice way of saying somebody.

192
00:10:25,840 --> 00:10:27,840
Or you can go sweetie pie.

193
00:10:28,960 --> 00:10:29,220
Sweetie pie.

194
00:10:29,960 --> 00:10:30,600
So pie is a food.

195
00:10:31,140 --> 00:10:31,700
It's like a dessert.

196
00:10:31,960 --> 00:10:32,960
Pie is sweet.

197
00:10:32,960 --> 00:10:33,960
It's a sweet.

198
00:10:33,960 --> 00:10:34,960
So sweetie pie.

199
00:10:34,960 --> 00:10:35,960
Or you could say honey pie.

200
00:10:35,960 --> 00:10:36,500
Honey pie, sweetie pie.

201
00:10:36,960 --> 00:10:37,560
So these are all cute.

202
00:10:37,960 --> 00:10:43,720
And the nice thing about these kind of pet names, these cute names, is you can change them if you want and they're yours.

203
