So you could say honey pie, sugar bun.

204
00:10:47,360 --> 00:10:49,640
They're silly, but there's no real rule.

205
00:10:49,820 --> 00:10:50,820
But these are the most common.

206
00:10:51,040 --> 00:10:52,040
Right.

207
00:10:52,040 --> 00:10:53,260
Sweetums and sweetie pie.

208
00:10:53,400 --> 00:10:54,400
Sweetie pie.

209
00:10:54,400 --> 00:10:55,400
Okay.

210
00:10:55,400 --> 00:10:58,980
Now, moving on to something a little bit maybe more formal.

211
00:10:59,760 --> 00:11:00,090
Dearest.

212
00:11:00,760 --> 00:11:00,950
Dearest.

213
00:11:01,760 --> 00:11:02,370
This makes me think of my grandparents.

214
00:11:02,810 --> 00:11:03,050
Oh, really?

215
00:11:03,760 --> 00:11:04,760
Dearest.

216
00:11:04,760 --> 00:11:06,230
So dearest comes from dear.

217
00:11:07,400 --> 00:11:08,520
