225
00:11:17,440 --> 00:11:17,750
Mother dearest.

226
00:11:18,440 --> 00:11:19,440
No, it's very 1930s.

227
00:11:19,440 --> 00:11:20,440
I'm so arrogant.

228
00:11:20,440 --> 00:11:22,760
Well, it's an old time thing.

229
00:11:22,760 --> 00:11:28,920
We do not say this anymore, but you can say, you know, dearest, would you mind moving the car?

230
00:11:28,920 --> 00:11:29,530
I like the accent.

231
00:11:29,920 --> 00:11:31,480
You're kind of like English.

232
00:11:31,850 --> 00:11:32,070
All right.

